    <cde:localId>V-000164</cde:localId>
    <cde:nodeType>Value</cde:nodeType>
    <cde:sourceDefinition>Both water- and blood-density fluids are seen within bone lesion on CT. Typically indicates aneurysmal bone cyst, but may also be giant cell tumor, telangectatic osteosarcoma, or chondroblastoma.</cde:sourceDefinition>
