    <cde:nodeType>Value</cde:nodeType>
    <cde:sourceDefinition>[TI-RADS]: Border has focal rounded soft tissue
protrusions that extend into the adjacent parenchyma.
The lobulations may be single or multiple
and may vary in conspicuity and size (small lobulations
are referred to as microlobulated)</cde:sourceDefinition>
