    <cde:localId>V-000393</cde:localId>
    <cde:nodeType>Value</cde:nodeType>
    <cde:sourceDefinition>PI-RADS:  uneven.  BI-RADS MRI:  Uneven or jagged edges (but not spiculated).  TI-RADS: without clear soft tissue protrusions into the parenchyma.
The protrusions may vary in size and conspicuity and may be present in only one portion of the nodule</cde:sourceDefinition>
    <cde:versionNumber rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</cde:versionNumber>
    <cde:versionStatus>proposed</cde:versionStatus>
  </rdf:Description>
