  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://radelement.org/ng/ScopeResolution">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Why an observation carries no anatomic scope. Same four-way shape as the presence element: the absence is recorded with its reason rather than left to a reader. Without it, one class means genuinely generic, the report did not say, and the extractor failed.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
