    <cde:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-10</cde:created>
    <cde:designNote>Post-coordinable: RadLex has pyelonephritis and chronic independently. Whether this is a distinct Diagnosis or a temporal-descriptor value on Pyelonephritis is the same question probe C3 asks about hemorrhage, and it is answered differently here because acute and chronic pyelonephritis manifest differently.</cde:designNote>
