  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://radelement.org/ng/componentOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Inverse of hasComponent. Functional: a sub-finding with no standalone meaning belongs to exactly one whole. This is what lets a conditional relationship be carried on the component rather than asserted as a requirement on the whole.</rdfs:comment>
