  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://radelement.org/ng/probe/E4_ScopedToLung">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>PROBE E4 [EXPECT CONSISTENT and nothing further - stays where it is, no yellow rows]: a finding scoped to the lung</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Deliberate test case, not part of the vocabulary. The other half of E3. If this probe does not do what its label says, a constraint has been lost or added. Only inconsistency shows as colour, so a probe expecting EQUIVALENT or SUBCLASS fails silently: check the Description panel, where the reasoner's conclusions appear as yellow rows, rather than looking for a colour in the tree.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:nodeID="n4404ee68d158488e83d8f931eae8c061b87"/>
    <cde:designNote>[Group E] expect: SATISFIABLE, and should subsume E3. The other half of E3.</cde:designNote>
  </rdf:Description>
