    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="la">organraum</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Anatomical cavity, which is surrounded by all morphological parts of an organ; is continuous within the organ; contains one or more body substances. Examples: pericardial cavity, cavity of stomach, uterine cavity.</skos:definition>
